Name:		opencaptainclaw
Version:	1.0
Release:	1
Summary:	"Open source reimplementation of Captain Claw (1997) platformer game"
License:	GPLv3+
URL:		https://github.com/pjasicek/OpenClaw
Requires:	mono-winforms

%description
The opencaptainclaw program is a reimplementation of original Captain Claw (1997) platformer
game developed by Monolith.

%files 
/usr/bin/opencaptainclaw
/usr/bin/ClawLauncher.exe
/usr/bin/clawlauncher
/usr/share/opencaptainclaw/CLAW.REZ
/usr/share/opencaptainclaw/ASSETS.ZIP
/usr/share/opencaptainclaw/clacon.ttf
/usr/share/opencaptainclaw/console02.tga
/usr/share/opencaptainclaw/config.xml
/usr/share/opencaptainclaw/SAVES.XML

